const NAVS=[{id:"dashboard",l:"Dashboard"},{id:"input",l:"Input Data"},{id:"run",l:"Run Simulation"},{id:"output",l:"Output Results"},{id:"manuals",l:"Manual"},{id:"casestudy",l:"Case Study"},{id:"help",l:"Help"},{id:"logout",l:"Logout"}];
const NICONS={dashboard:"M3 3h4v4H3zM9 3h4v4H9zM3 9h4v4H3zM9 9h4v4H9z",input:"M4 6h8M4 9h5M4 12h6",run:"M5 3l8 5-8 5V3z",output:"M3 12l4-4 3 3 5-6",manuals:"M4 3h5l3 3v8H4zM9 3v3h3",casestudy:"M3 3h10v3H3zM3 8h4v5H3zM9 8h4v5H9z",help:"M8 5a3 3 0 010 6M8 13v1",logout:"M10 8H3M6 5l-3 3 3 3M13 3v10"};
function Sidebar({nav,setNav}){return <div style={{width:172,flexShrink:0,background:G.dark,display:"flex",flexDirection:"column",overflow:"hidden"}}><div style={{padding:"14px 14px 10px",borderBottom:"0.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08)"}}><div style={{display:"flex",alignItems:"center",gap:8}}><div style={{width:28,height:28,background:G.accent,borderRadius:6,display:"flex",alignItems:"center",justifyContent:"center",flexShrink:0}}><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="5" stroke="#7fe8a8" strokeWidth="1.5"/><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="2" fill="#7fe8a8"/><line x1="8" y1="1" x2="8" y2="4" stroke="#7fe8a8" strokeWidth="1.2"/></svg></div><div style={{fontSize:15,fontWeight:500,color:"#fff",letterSpacing:0.3}}>Cem<span style={{color:G.accent2}}>OPTI</span></div></div><div style={{fontSize:10,color:"rgba(255,255,255,0.35)",marginTop:3,lineHeight:1.4}}>Cementing Simulation Software</div></div><div style={{flex:1,paddingTop:6,overflowY:"auto"}}>{NAVS.map(n=>(<div key={n.id} onClick={()=>setNav(n.id)} style={{display:"flex",alignItems:"center",gap:9,padding:"7px 14px",cursor:"pointer",borderLeft:`2px solid ${nav===n.id?G.accent2:"transparent"}`,background:nav===n.id?"rgba(26,107,60,0.25)":"transparent"}}><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" strokeWidth="1.4" strokeLinecap="round" strokeLinejoin="round" style={{color:nav===n.id?"#7fe8a8":"rgba(255,255,255,0.45)",flexShrink:0}}><path d={NICONS[n.id]||"M8 8"}/></svg><span style={{fontSize:12,color:nav===n.id?"#fff":"rgba(255,255,255,0.65)",fontWeight:nav===n.id?500:400}}>{n.l}</span></div>))}</div><div style={{padding:"10px 14px",borderTop:"0.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08)",fontSize:10,color:"rgba(255,255,255,0.2)",lineHeight:1.6}}>© 2025 KemiServe FZE<br/>All rights reserved.</div></div>;}

